l4":0.9824,"nums":0,"nums_kept":0,"out_edu":1.771,"out_words":514,"seed_edu":1.315,"src_words":189},{"audience":"general","format":"blogpost","i":1264,"novel4":0.9567,"nums":1,"nums_kept":1,"out_edu":3.881,"out_words":650,"seed_edu":2.491,"src_words":170},{"audience":"general","format":"blogpost","i":804,"novel4":0.9835,"nums":17,"nums_kept":6,"out_edu":2.567,"out_words":428,"seed_edu":1.43,"src_words":163},{"audience":"general","format":"blogpost","i":375,"novel4":0.9571,"nums":1,"nums_kept":1,"out_edu":2.897,"out_words":609,"seed_edu":1.125,"src_words":123},{"audience":"general","format":"blogpost","i":838,"novel4":0.9833,"nums":2,"nums_kept":2,"out_edu":1.378,"out_words":721,"seed_edu":0.417,"src_words":19},{"audience":"general","format":"blogpost","i":335,"novel4":0.9608,"nums":5,"nums_kept":4,"out_edu":1.395,"out_words":335,"seed_edu":0.196,"src_words":65},{"audience":"college_students","format":"textbook_academic_tone","i":1267,"novel4":0.9956,"nums":1,"nums_kept":0,"out_edu":2.15,"out_words":918,"seed_edu":1.586,"src_words":110}],"cosmo_agg":{"len_ratio_median":3.5875659428291007,"n":200,"novel4_median":0.9922,"nums":757,"nums_kept":248,"out_edu_mean":2.25879,"out_pass":79,"seed_edu_mean":1.16134,"seed_pass":9},"docs":[{"edu":1.408,"id":"<urn:uuid:7b011a1d-3f79-4c04-977c-b87905776b0e>","source":"Hundreds of Muslims in north-western China are engaged in a standoff with authorities to prevent their mosque from being demolished. Officials said the newly built Weizhou Grand Mosque in the Ningxia region had not been given proper building permits. But worshippers refused to back down. One resident said they would not \"let the government touch the mosque\". The new mosque was completed only last year, and city authorities initially wanted it torn down by Friday, citing a lack of proper planning and construction permits. Amid public outrage, authorities softened their demolition order to a \"rectification plan\" that demanded a less 'Arab' and more Chinese look. \"The first version of that plan called for the mosque’s 'Arab-style' domes to be replaced with traditional Chinese-style pagodas but was swiftly rejected by worshippers,\" reports the Hong Kong-based South China Morning Post. \"The government then asked the mosque’s management committee to remove eight of the nine domes that top the mosque, leaving the largest one in the centre. That, too, was deemed unacceptable by most members of the community.\"","styles":{"easy":{"edu":1.666,"model":"Qwen3-4B-Q4_K_M (CPU smoke test)","novel4":1.0,"nums":0,"nums_kept":0,"out_words":124,"output":"Many Muslims in China are fighting to keep their mosque. The mosque is in a place called Ningxia. The mosque was built last year. The government said the mosque was not built properly. The people who pray there do not want the mosque to be destroyed. They say the government should not touch their mosque. The government wanted to tear down the mosque. But the people did not agree. The government changed their plan. Now they want to make the mosque look more like China. They wanted to change the dome of the mosque. The people did not like that. They said no. The government tried again. They wanted to remove some domes. The people still did not like that. They said no again.","src_words":181,"tokens":144},"hard":{"edu":1.741,"model":"Qwen3-4B-Q4_K_M (CPU smoke test)","novel4":0.9628,"nums":0,"nums_kept":0,"out_words":191,"output":"Numerous adherents of the Islamic faith in the northwest provinces of China are in a protracted confrontation with state authorities, striving to forestall the destruction of their place of worship. Authorities assert that the recently constructed Weizhou Grand Mosque in the Ningxia region was not afforded the requisite municipal approvals. Nevertheless, the faithful persist in their resistance. A local resident affirmed that they would not \"permit the state apparatus to encroach upon the mosque.\" The edifice was completed mere months ago, and municipal authorities initially mooted its demolition by Friday, citing infractions in urban planning and construction regulation. In the face of public dissent, the authorities revised their directive to a \"corrective initiative,\" which mandated a more 'Sinocentric' aesthetic. \"The inaugural iteration of this initiative proposed the substitution of the mosque’s 'Orientalist' domes with traditional Chinese 'pagodas,' yet this proposal was promptly repudiated by the congregants,\" notes the South China Morning Post, based in Hong Kong. \"The government subsequently solicited the mosque’s administrative body to eliminate eight of the nine domes, retaining only the central one. This measure, too, was regarded as unacceptable by the majority of the community.\"","src_words":181,"tokens":247},"medium":{"edu":1.417,"model":"Qwen3-4B-Q4_K_M (CPU smoke test)","novel4":0.7978,"nums":0,"nums_kept":0,"out_words":181,"output":"Numerous Muslims in northernwestern China are involved in a confrontation with government officials to prevent their mosque from being demolished. Authorities stated that the newly constructed Weizhou Grand Mosque in the Ningxia area had not received the necessary building permits. However, the worshippers have refused to yield. One local resident claimed they would not \"allow the government to touch the mosque.\" The new mosque was completed just last year, and city officials initially planned to demolish it by Friday, citing inadequate planning and construction permits. In the face of public outrage, the authorities adjusted their demolition order to a \"rectification plan\" that aimed for a more \"Chinese\" appearance. \"The initial version of that plan proposed replacing the mosque's 'Arab-style' domes with traditional Chinese-style pagodas, but this was quickly rejected by the worshippers,\" reported the South China Morning Post from Hong Kong. \"The government then requested the mosque's management committee to remove eight of the nine domes that cover the mosque, leaving the largest one in the center. However, this too was considered unacceptable by the majority of the community.\"","src_words":181,"tokens":224},"qa":{"edu":1.63,"model":"Qwen3-4B-Q4_K_M (CPU smoke test)","novel4":0.5288,"nums":0,"nums_kept":0,"out_words":298,"output":"**Question:** What is the current situation involving the mosque in north-western China?  \n**Answer:** Hundreds of Muslims in north-western China are engaged in a standoff with authorities to prevent their mosque from being demolished.\n\n**Question:** What is the name of the mosque in question?  \n**Answer:** The Weizhou Grand Mosque in the Ningxia region.\n\n**Question:** Why did the authorities want to demolish the mosque?  \n**Answer:** Officials said the newly built Weizhou Grand Mosque had not been given proper building permits.\n\n**Question:** How did the worshippers respond to the authorities' decision?  \n**Answer:** Worshippers refused to back down. One resident said they would not \"let the government touch the mosque\".\n\n**Question:** When was the new mosque completed?  \n**Answer:** The new mosque was completed only last year.\n\n**Question:** What did the city authorities initially want to do with the mosque?  \n**Answer:** City authorities initially wanted it torn down by Friday, citing a lack of proper planning and construction permits.\n\n**Question:** How did the authorities change their decision after public outrage?  \n**Answer:** Authorities softened their demolition order to a \"rectification plan\" that demanded a less 'Arab' and more Chinese look.\n\n**Question:** What was the first version of the \"rectification plan\"?  \n**Answer:** The first version of that plan called for the mosque’s \"Arab-style\" domes to be replaced with traditional Chinese-style pagodas.\n\n**Question:** What happened with the first version of the plan?  \n**Answer:** That was swiftly rejected by worshippers.\n\n**Question:** What did the government then ask the mosque’s management committee to do?  \n**Answer:** The government then asked the mosque’s management committee to remove eight of the nine domes that top the mosque, leaving the largest one in the centre.\n\n**Question:** What was the outcome of that request?  \n**Answer:** That, too, was deemed unacceptable by most members of the community.","src_words":181,"tokens":410}},"url":"https://archinect.com/news/article/150077251/chinese-hui-muslims-resist-order-to-demolish-new-mosque"},{"edu":0.905,"id":"<urn:uuid:19fcd8de-387a-409a-ba8f-0c9390ef0318>","source":"Dive into the adrenaline-rushing world of Dune Drive, a captivating racing game that challenges your driving skills like never before. Navigate your car across treacherous terrains, overcoming challenging obstacles while aiming to cover vast distances. The game's stunning graphics, immersive sound effects, and dynamic controls contribute to an exhilarating gaming experience. How to play Playing Dune Drive is all about mastering control over your car. As you set off on the race track, employ quick reflexes to dodge obstacles using mouse clicks or touch controls for mobile users. Consistent speed and careful maneuvering are key to scoring high and unlocking new levels. Tips and Tricks In Dune Drive, momentum is your friend. Take advantage of downhill slopes to gain speed and clear difficult obstacles. Timing your jumps precisely can save you from potential crashes while ensuring smooth rides. Aim for consistency over speed. - Vivid 3D graphics that enhance the gaming experience - Diverse terrains and challenging tracks - Intuitive controls suitable for players of all proficiency levels - Addictive gameplay with progressively difficult levels - Captivating sound effects that augment your racing journey","styles":{"easy":{"edu":1.061,"model":"Qwen3-4B-Q4_K_M (CPU smoke test)","novel4":1.0,"nums":0,"nums_kept":0,"out_words":147,"output":"Dune Drive is a game where you drive a car. The game is exciting. You drive on big tracks. The tracks are hard. You have to avoid things. You have to go fast. The game is fun. You can play on a computer or a phone. The game has good pictures. The game has good sounds. The game is easy to play. You can learn to drive. You can get better. You can win. You can get new levels. You can jump. You can go down hills. You can go fast. You can avoid crashes. You can be careful. You can be smart. You can win. You can have fun. You can play again. You can try again. You can play with friends. You can play alone. You can have a good time. You can enjoy the game. You can have fun. You can play Dune Drive.","src_words":181,"tokens":181},"hard":{"edu":1.103,"model":"Qwen3-4B-Q4_K_M (CPU smoke test)","novel4":1.0,"nums":0,"nums_kept":0,"out_words":251,"output":"In the realm of vehicular exhilaration, *Dune Drive* proffers a singular odyssey of velocity and dexterity, wherein the driver's acumen is scrutinized with a precision befitting the most discerning connoisseur. To partake in this gamut of kinetic fervor, one must navigate a landscape rife with perilous topography, where the mastery of locomotion becomes the sine qua non of triumph. The game's visual tapestry, replete with hyper-realistic renderings and sonorous ambiance, orchestrates a symphony of sensory immersion, rendering each passage a crescendo of sensory delight.\n\nTo engage, the player must adeptly command their vehicle, employing nimble reflexes to elude impediments through either cursoric interaction or tactile interface, as befitting mobile participants. The essence of progression lies in the harmonious interplay of velocity and precision, wherein sustained speed and calculated maneuvering yield the keys to ascension through the tiers of challenge. \n\nStrategic insight dictates that momentum, harnessed through the deft utilization of inclines, becomes the linchpin of success. The art of timing, particularly in the execution of aerial traversals, is paramount to avert collision and ensure a seamless trajectory. Above all, the pursuit of consistency, rather than the fleeting chase of speed, is the tenet that shall elevate the player to the zenith of this dynamic arena.\n\nThe game's attributes include a resplendent three-dimensional visual lexicon, a panoply of varied and treacherous tracks, an intuitive interface accommodating a spectrum of expertise, an addictive progression arc marked by escalating difficulty, and an auditory design that amplifies the visceral thrill of the pursuit.","src_words":181,"tokens":348},"medium":{"edu":0.924,"model":"Qwen3-4B-Q4_K_M (CPU smoke test)","novel4":0.9124,"nums":0,"nums_kept":0,"out_words":197,"output":"Immerse yourself in the heart-pounding world of Dune Drive, an exhilarating racing game that pushes the boundaries of driving skill. Navigate your vehicle through perilous landscapes, conquering challenging obstacles while striving to cover extensive distances. The game's remarkable visuals, immersive audio, and responsive controls create an unforgettable gaming experience.  \n\n**How to Play**  \nParticipating in Dune Drive revolves around precise control of your vehicle. As you begin your journey on the race track, rely on swift reflexes to avoid obstacles using either mouse clicks or touch controls for mobile players. Maintaining steady speed and meticulous handling are essential for achieving high scores and unlocking additional levels.  \n\n**Tips and Tricks**  \nIn Dune Drive, momentum is a crucial asset. Utilize downhill slopes to increase your speed and navigate through tough obstacles. Accurately timing your jumps can prevent crashes and ensure a smooth ride. Focus on consistency rather than sheer speed.  \n\n- **Stunning 3D graphics** that elevate the overall gaming experience  \n- **Varied terrains and challenging tracks** that test your skills  \n- **User-friendly controls** designed for players of all skill levels  \n- **Engaging gameplay** with increasingly difficult challenges as you progress  \n- **Compelling sound effects** that enhance the intensity of your racing adventure","src_words":181,"tokens":265},"qa":{"edu":1.088,"model":"Qwen3-4B-Q4_K_M (CPU smoke test)","novel4":0.5426,"nums":0,"nums_kept":0,"out_words":261,"output":"**Question:** What is Dune Drive?  \n**Answer:** Dune Drive is an adrenaline-rushing racing game that challenges your driving skills like never before.  \n\n**Question:** What kind of environments does the game feature?  \n**Answer:** The game features treacherous terrains and challenging obstacles that players must navigate across vast distances.  \n\n**Question:** What makes the gaming experience in Dune Drive so exciting?  \n**Answer:** The game's stunning graphics, immersive sound effects, and dynamic controls contribute to an exhilarating gaming experience.  \n\n**Question:** How do players play Dune Drive?  \n**Answer:** Playing Dune Drive is all about mastering control over your car. As you set off on the race track, you need to use quick reflexes to dodge obstacles using mouse clicks or touch controls for mobile users.  \n\n**Question:** What are some key strategies for success in Dune Drive?  \n**Answer:** Consistent speed and careful maneuvering are key to scoring high and unlocking new levels.  \n\n**Question:** What is a tip for improving performance in Dune Drive?  \n**Answer:** Momentum is your friend. Take advantage of downhill slopes to gain speed and clear difficult obstacles.  \n\n**Question:** How should players approach jumps in the game?  \n**Answer:** Timing your jumps precisely can save you from potential crashes while ensuring smooth rides.  \n\n**Question:** What is recommended when it comes to gameplay strategy?  \n**Answer:** Aim for consistency over speed.  \n\n**Question:** What are some of the game's standout features?  \n**Answer:** - Vivid 3D graphics that enhance the gaming experience  \n- Diverse terrains and challenging tracks  \n- Intuitive controls suitable for players of all proficiency levels  \n- Addictive gameplay with progressively difficult levels  \n- Captivating sound effects that augment your racing journey","src_words":181,"tokens":371}},"url":"https://flames.games/play/dune-drive"}],"syn_file":"rephrase_smoke.jsonl"}